<title>USA: Lenox, Mass., won by Fidelity Capital Mkts.</title>
<headline>Lenox, Mass., won by Fidelity Capital Mkts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Capital Mkts said it won $10.990 million of Lenox, Mass., school project loan, act of 1948 bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.1737 percent.</p>
</text>
